{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56255","headline":"赠孙真人 · 可朋","name":"赠孙真人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世上屡更改，山中常晏安。\n六爻穷《易》象，九转链神丹。\n洞里花开晚，峯头雪落残。\n爲余琴一弄，鹤舞下松端。\n（影印本《诗渊》第一册第四○七页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"可朋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}